          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher rates of trade rerouting and transshipment to avoid Iran-related restrictions increase transit distances, handling steps and coordination frictions, directly lengthening component delivery times for semiconductor and AI hardware supply chains." />
