          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher rates of trade rerouting increase settlement friction and compliance costs for banks and prime brokers, reducing available balance‑sheet capacity and forcing leveraged Treasury investors to cut gross and duration exposures." />
