          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Improved short‑term funding liquidity (cheaper/available repo and interbank lines) directly reduces payment frictions and collateral constraints for banks and exporters, enabling faster letters of credit, arms payments and logistics financing so external military assistance shipments accelerate." />
