          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Heightened military risk raises shipping interruptions, port congestion, and insurance and inspection burdens, forcing suppliers to reroute shipments and increasing end-to-end lead times for AI hardware components." />
