          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Escalation increases counterparty risk perceptions and margin volatility, causing banks and repo counterparties to hoard cash and tighten collateral acceptance, which directly reduces short‑term funding availability and raises funding costs for Treasury market participants." />
